(F5 T2 V7: materi_strain_plasti_camclay / _mohr_coul / _tension / _vonmises
 (manual Professional 4.34, 4.41-4.43) on the bar of control_materi_plasti_tension_apply_yield1 without
 the apply record (plastic): the dof of the
 group's model (tension) equals materi_strain_plasti at every node, the other
 three stay 0 (scripts/build_safe.sh). The Professional 02-08-2026 adds no
 dof for these initialisations and rejects _camclay (DIVERGENCES
 STRAIN-PLASTI-MODEL-DOFS).)
(F5 W1: control_materi_plasti_tension_apply 1 -no also ignores the tension
 yield surface (group_materi_plasti_tension), not only tension_direct
 (manual Pro 6.150 "any tension-plasticity data"). 1D bar E 2, yield 1,
 strain 1.5: timestep 1 elastic. Professional 02-08-2026: sigxx 3, eppxx
 0. GNU before F5: 1 / 1.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_strain_plasti
materi_strain_plasti_camclay
materi_strain_plasti_mohr_coul
materi_strain_plasti_tension
materi_strain_plasti_vonmises
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1  0
node 2  1
element 1  -bar2 1 2
bounda_dof 0  1 -velx
bounda_time 0  0.
bounda_dof 1  2 -velx
bounda_time 1  1.
group_type 0  -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0  2.0
group_materi_memory 0  -total_linear
group_materi_plasti_tension 0  1.
control_timestep 0  0.5 0.5
control_timestep 1  1. 1.
end_data
